\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-info x-info-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Katherine was named Chief Compliance Officer of Penserra Capital Management in January 2025. She joined Penserra in June 2024. Prior to her work at Penserra, Katherine was a compliance officer at Blackrock. Prior to that, she held roles in compliance and regulatory administration at large financial institutions.<\/p>\n<p>Katherine graduated from Quinnipiac University with a Bachelor of Arts degree and currently holds security license 65.<\/p>\n \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><!-- end x-item --><div class=\"x-item\"  data-path=\"lee-geiger\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"squared\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Lee-Geiger_0778-500x333.jpg\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Lee-Geiger_0778-500x333.jpg\" class=\"isquared\" alt=\"Lee Geiger\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-thumbnail-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Lee-Geiger_0778-500x333.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Lee Geiger<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Chief Compliance Officer, Penserra Global Investors & Penserra Wealth Management<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-info x-info-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lee was named Chief Compliance Officer of Penserra Global Investors and Penserra Wealth Management in January 2025. He joined Penserra in April 2009 and in January 2018 become Penserra\u2019s Director of Marketing. In 2021, he added Compliance Officer and Financial and Operations Principal (FinOp) to his job responsibilities. Prior to his administrative roles, Lee spent thirty years as an institutional equity sales trader, demonstrating a history of management, sales, trading, compliance, and marketing.<\/p>\n<p>Lee graduated from Claremont McKenna College with a Bachelor of Arts degree and from the Amos Tuck School of Business Administration at Dartmouth College with a Masters of Business Administration, and currently holds security licenses 3, 7, 24, 52, 53, 63, 65, 99, and SIE.<\/p>\n \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><!-- end x-item --><\/div><script type=\"text\/javascript\">\n\t\tjQuery(document).ready(function($) {\n\t\tvar $xpanda = jQuery(\"#xpanda-9\");\n\t\tvar itemsPerRow = 4;\n\t\t$xpanda.xpanda({\n\t\t\tbreakpoints: {\n\t\t\t\txs: { itemsPerRow: 1 },\n\t\t\t\tsm: { itemsPerRow: 2 },\n\t\t\t\tmd: { itemsPerRow: 3 },\n\t\t\t\tlg: { itemsPerRow: itemsPerRow },\n\t\t\t\txl: { itemsPerRow: itemsPerRow },\n\t\t\t\txx: { itemsPerRow: itemsPerRow }\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\telement: {\n\t\t\t\tspaceBetweenItems: 25,\n\t\t\t\tspaceBetweenRows: 20\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\tindependent: true,\n\t\t\thistory: true\n\t\t});\n\t});\n\t<\/script>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Administration<\/h2>\n\n\n<div id=\"xpanda-10\" class=\"xpanda \" data-instance=\"10\" ><div class=\"x-item\"  data-path=\"annette-thomas\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"squared\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/Annette-Thomas-Fina-sql-500x500.jpg\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/Annette-Thomas-Fina-sql-500x500.jpg\" class=\"isquared\" alt=\"Annette Thomas\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-thumbnail-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/Annette-Thomas-Fina-sql-500x500.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Annette Thomas<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Director, Head of Accounting<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-info x-info-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Annette joined Penserra in 2017 as Vice President and Senior Accountant, quickly earning a promotion to Director of Accounting the following year. In her leadership role, she oversees and optimizes all aspects of Penserra\u2019s accounting operations, ensuring accuracy, compliance, and efficiency across processes and procedures. Annette brings a wealth of expertise to her role with over 15 years of experience spanning accounting, tax, and risk management. Known for her attention to detail and collaborative approach, Annette is recognized for implementing process improvements and fostering cross-functional teamwork. Originally from the Greater Philadelphia area where her career started at Deloitte Tax and later joining South Jersey Industries. Annette joined Penserra in Orinda, CA before transitioning to Penserra\u2019s Chicago office in 2019. Annette balances her professional achievements with a strong commitment to family and community, embodying both dedication and enthusiasm in every aspect of her life and work.<\/p>\n<p>Annette graduated from Cabrini College with a Bachelor of Science degree.<\/p>\n \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><!-- end x-item --><div class=\"x-item\"  data-path=\"annette-finnane-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"squared\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Annette-Finnane-500x333.jpg\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Annette-Finnane-500x333.jpg\" class=\"isquared\" alt=\"Annette Finnane\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-thumbnail-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Annette-Finnane-500x333.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Annette Finnane<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Director, Head of Human Resources<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-info x-info-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Annette joined Penserra in September 2018 as an Associate\/HR Assistant. In 2020, she was named Director of Human Resources.<\/p>\n<p>Annette graduated from Santa Clara University with a Bachelor of Science degree.<\/p>\n \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><!-- end x-item --><div class=\"x-item\"  data-path=\"guadalupe-nunez-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"squared\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Guadalupe-Nunez-500x345.jpg\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Guadalupe-Nunez-500x345.jpg\" class=\"isquared\" alt=\"Guadalupe Nunez\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-thumbnail-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Guadalupe-Nunez-500x345.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Guadalupe Nunez<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Executive Assistant<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x-info x-info-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Guadalupe serves as an assistant to the C-Suite, bringing organization, discretion, and a proactive spirit to the heart of the firm\u2019s operations. In addition to managing executive schedules and priorities, she plays a key role in driving internal initiatives that strengthen team culture and boost morale. Guadalupe is known for her reliability, positive energy, and commitment to fostering a collaborative and supportive workplace.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><!-- end x-item --><\/div><script type=\"text\/javascript\">\n\t\tjQuery(document).ready(function($) {\n\t\tvar $xpanda = jQuery(\"#xpanda-10\");\n\t\tvar itemsPerRow = 4;\n\t\t$xpanda.xpanda({\n\t\t\tbreakpoints: {\n\t\t\t\txs: { itemsPerRow: 1 },\n\t\t\t\tsm: { itemsPerRow: 2 },\n\t\t\t\tmd: { itemsPerRow: 3 },\n\t\t\t\tlg: { itemsPerRow: itemsPerRow },\n\t\t\t\txl: { itemsPerRow: itemsPerRow },\n\t\t\t\txx: { itemsPerRow: itemsPerRow }\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\telement: {\n\t\t\t\tspaceBetweenItems: 25,\n\t\t\t\tspaceBetweenRows: 20\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\tindependent: true,\n\t\t\thistory: true\n\t\t});\n\t});\n\t<\/script>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Executive Investment Banking Global Equity Trading Equity Exchange Fixed Income Trading ETF Sub-Advising Active Investment Management Operations Compliance Administration<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":87,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_gspb_post_css":"","_kad_blocks_custom_css":"","_kad_blocks_head_custom_js":"","_kad_blocks_body_custom_js":"","_kad_blocks_footer_custom_js":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5053","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Leadership<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Penserra Securities LLC (\u201cPenserra\u201d) is an institutional financial services firm with offices located in New York, Chicago, and the San Francisco Bay Area. Services include global equity trading, fixed income trading, investment banking, ETF Sub-Advising,